# Third-party sources vendored for the Skia build. Never reformat these — the
# diff against their upstreams is the only way to audit them.
vendor/

# Build output and dependencies.
target/
node_modules/
lib/skia.node
package-lock.json

# Test fixtures are compared byte-for-byte.
tests/assets/

# Workflow YAML is deliberately out of scope rather than merely unformatted:
# these files are read against GitHub's own examples more often than they are
# edited, and matching those is worth more than matching the rest of the tree.
#
# Markdown used to sit here too, on the grounds that `just release` parses
# CHANGELOG.md and reflowing it risked the release notes. It is formatted now,
# because that risk turned out not to exist -- Prettier reflows prose and list
# markers and never touches a heading, and the extractor keys on `## ` lines
# alone. Checked rather than assumed: after the first reformat it still finds
# every section it did before, at the same bounds, for both the npm and the
# crate version strings.
.github/
